tps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/223f0ab02aabe2e684d0f5bf2071752a.webm?t=1760720504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/223f0ab02aabe2e684d0f5bf2071752a.mp4?t=1760720504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/67774ddd8382b2bc64bf56a2e1bf2936.avif?t=1760720504\" width=1560 height=309 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore beyond the tavern</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Go on adventures and quest with friends, putting your skill and wit to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/7be1140a1537deee53cd4957ccf8f9a3.poster.avif?t=1760720504\" width=780 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/7be1140a1537deee53cd4957ccf8f9a3.webm?t=1760720504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/7be1140a1537deee53cd4957ccf8f9a3.mp4?t=1760720504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/f999cdd304ea2a68c96f441585baf6fa.avif?t=1760720504\" width=1560 height=337 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Create your own brawler archetype</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Equip a set of 4 unique abilities. What will you become?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perhaps an untouchable ranger that sets up traps and summons a pet to fight alongside you, or a\u00a0teleporting mage that controls the battlefield with a mix of ice and fire. If\u00a0convention doesn't speak to you, you can play as a stealthy rogue that runs around healing and resurrecting allies or create your own class!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/c8e5ad4451680ffcf8c591cb0e656bc3.avif?t=1760720504\" width=1560 height=323 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join the Tavern Games and festivities! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play solo or coordinate with a team in dozens of fun engaging game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/984dc014104d3f606d30a22abd7eff7f.poster.avif?t=1760720504\" width=780 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/984dc014104d3f606d30a22abd7eff7f.webm?t=1760720504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/984dc014104d3f606d30a22abd7eff7f.mp4?t=1760720504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Notable Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monthly Tournaments</strong>\u00a0- Watch or brawl live for glory and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ELO Rating System -</strong>\u00a0Progress from bronze to grandmaster+.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Shop -</strong>\u00a0All items are purchasable with currency earned in-game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fair Play</strong>\u00a0- No grind or pay-to-win. Just skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong>\u00a0- Easy to pick up, glorifying to truly master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World -</strong>\u00a0Explore beyond the tavern and uncover new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests -</strong>\u00a0Embark on solo or co-op adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-Platform Multiplayer</strong>\u00a0- Play on mobile or PC.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild Customization</strong>\u00a0- Design and submit your own guild outfits and emblems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator Mode &amp; Replays</strong>\u00a0- Watch live matches or re-watch past matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Game Modes</strong>\u00a0- More variety and game modes to come.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513320?t=1760720504","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/9d6b5f3bd2366092bd11b3a2296d162f56cf2fc9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760720504","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/65982b9bd47bd330ceb4c8112e2e2bdabfc8323d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760720504","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/65982b9bd47bd330ceb4c8112e2e2bdabfc8323d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760720504","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Tavern!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure like Link and party like Mario. Brawl your way through ranked arenas, sports-style gam