doesn't speak to you, you can play as a stealthy rogue that runs around healing and resurrecting allies or create your own class!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/c8e5ad4451680ffcf8c591cb0e656bc3.avif?t=1760720504\" width=1560 height=323 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join the Tavern Games and festivities! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play solo or coordinate with a team in dozens of fun engaging game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/984dc014104d3f606d30a22abd7eff7f.poster.avif?t=1760720504\" width=780 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/984dc014104d3f606d30a22abd7eff7f.webm?t=1760720504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/984dc014104d3f606d30a22abd7eff7f.mp4?t=1760720504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Notable Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monthly Tournaments</strong>\u00a0- Watch or brawl live for glory and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ELO Rating System -</strong>\u00a0Progress from bronze to grandmaster+.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Shop -</strong>\u00a0All items are purchasable with currency earned in-game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fair Play</strong>\u00a0- No grind or pay-to-win. Just skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong>\u00a0- Easy to pick up, glorifying to truly master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World -</strong>\u00a0Explore beyond the tavern and uncover new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests -</strong>\u00a0Embark on solo or co-op adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-Platform Multiplayer</strong>\u00a0- Play on mobile or PC.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild Customization</strong>\u00a0- Design and submit your own guild outfits and emblems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator Mode &amp; Replays</strong>\u00a0- Watch live matches or re-watch past matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Game Modes</strong>\u00a0- More variety and game modes to come.</p>","developers":["Tavern Door Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/dc468719eb7bb621706759334cb0bacc07709b48/header.jpg?t=1760720504","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3513320/1778521406/09fb0575bc7ee43697cf2e78bb197d52c7769ba5/1750857235/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751027397","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3513320/1778521406/09fb0575bc7ee43697cf2e78bb197d52c7769ba5/1750857235/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751027397","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3513320/1778521406/09fb0575bc7ee43697cf2e78bb197d52c7769ba5/1750857235/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1